  periods do i face extra obstacles  absolutely from the slave trade to  beyonce black people have been  shaping and contributing to country  music since the start  and while the united states has made  some progress in black representation in  some genres of music and entertainment  it's important that history provides a  holistic depiction  of all of our contributions because  black history  is american history  [Music]  you

